# Building a Design System with Tailwind CSS v4

Tailwind CSS v4 introduces a new API that makes building design systems more powerful than ever. In this post, I'll walk through the key concepts.

## The @theme Directive

The `@theme` directive lets you define design tokens in CSS:

```css
@theme inline {
  --color-primary: var(--primary);
  --color-secondary: var(--secondary);
  --radius-lg: 0.75rem;
}
```

## CSS Variables for Theming

Using CSS variables with Tailwind v4 makes dark mode and theming seamless:

```css
:root {
  --background: #FFFFFF;
  --foreground: #0A0A0B;
}

.dark {
  --background: #0A0A0B;
  --foreground: #FAFAFA;
}
```

This is just the beginning. The new API opens up many possibilities.
